Having trouble with Corporate Dominance? Here are the quick answers, and how to reach us.

Common questions

How do I restore my purchases?
Open the App, go to Settings (the gear button), and tap Restore purchases. All-Access, Remove Ads and other one-time purchases come back on the same Apple ID. Cash packs are used when bought and are not restored.

My progress was lost. Can I get it back?
Saves live on your device. If iCloud is on for the App, your active save is also in your iCloud account and comes back after a reinstall or on a new device (Settings > Cloud save shows the last sync). Settings > Roll back restores an earlier backup of a save slot, except in Ironman runs. Without iCloud, a deleted App cannot be recovered.

The game is crashing or not loading.
Close the App completely and reopen it. Make sure you have the latest version from the store, then restart your device. If it keeps happening, send a bug report from Settings (below): it carries the build number and a save fingerprint so we can reproduce it.

How do I turn off ads?
Remove Ads in the in-game Store removes banner and interstitial ads for good. Rewarded ads stay optional; you only ever see one when you choose to watch it.

How do I turn off notifications?
Settings > Reminders. Reminders are off until you turn them on. You can also turn notifications off for the App in your device settings.

Which devices are supported?
iPhone and iPad with iOS 15.0 or later.

Is this investment advice?
No. Corporate Dominance is a simulation. The companies and people in it are invented, and nothing in it is financial, legal, tax or investment advice.

Send feedback or report a bug
